// Category: the --parse-only open-theory printer (`prettyOpenTheory`),
// which no corpus gate runs: the gates load and close every theory.
//
// A process location too wide for one line wraps in place, aligned under
// its opening parenthesis.

theory Loc begin
functions: f/4
process: (out('hello_world_hello_world'))@f('aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa','aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa','aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa','aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa')
end
